# Project-confidential strings the leak audit must never find in tracked
# files. One per line; blank lines and # comments ignored. Matched literally,
# case-sensitively, as substrings.
#
# Copy to scripts/leak-patterns.local (gitignored) and fill in the real
# values. This example file is committed; the .local one never is.
#
# Include: client and site names, facility abbreviations, document number
# series, real fire & gas zone IDs, and real instrument tag series.

# Client / site / facility names
ExampleClientName
ExampleSiteName

# Document number series
00-00-00

# Facility abbreviation
XYZ

# Real fire & gas zone IDs
FZ00_SZ00

# Real instrument tag series (hyphens included so partial numbers don't match)
-0000-
